          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora comes home from a long day at work to her girlfriend's cooking and gives Catra a surprise after they eat dinner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sequel to The Lens I See You Through&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Can be read as a stand alone, but better with context!)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
